{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"chatcmpl-f85525ab-cde1-4804-b2ed-ee8322ce179a","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"chatcmpl-tool-89085443848fe368","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/private/var/folders/h5/l8qslbp55w5621qf9ngsh5jc0000gn/T/epic-RHAISTRAT-9020-_h9vt6_q/artifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E003.md","content":"# Konflux build pipeline for the vLLM ROCm runtime image\n\n## Description\n\nThis epic onboards the vLLM ROCm container image build into Konflux, the platform's build pipeline, so the ROCm runtime variant is built, scanned, and attested with the same release rigor as the existing CUDA runtime images. The vLLM midstream repository is already Konflux-onboarded for its CUDA images; this epic adds the pipeline configuration for the new ROCm image variant.\n\n## Scope\n\n- Add Konflux build-pipeline configuration for the vLLM ROCm container image in the existing midstream vLLM repository.\n- Wire the image build, including its base-image and dependency inputs, into the pipeline's build and release tasks.\n- Ensure the pipeline produces the image with the required attestations so it can ship as a supported runtime artifact.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- A Konflux build pipeline configuration exists for the vLLM ROCm container image in the midstream vLLM repository.\n- The pipeline produces a green build of the ROCm image, including the required signed attestations for release.\n\n## HLR Traceability\n\n- HLR-2 (P0): a supported vLLM ROCm serving runtime productized for the cleared models — this epic provides the build-pipeline half of that productization (work-product-type split from the runtime productization work; the two run in parallel by rule, coupled only through the runtime epic's build-pipeline-green acceptance criterion).\n\n## Risks and Notes\n\n- The ROCm image's base layers come from AMD's published ROCm images; upstream base-image cadence may require pipeline input updates (fix-and-retry, not a structural change).\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":45686,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-91f30b115d6e219b","agent_id":"a5586881f516d3574","session_id":"985c5314-dfa6-4bcb-a27c-c01e92aa4111","uuid":"d737a9d8-461e-429d-967d-58df038d36a2","timestamp":"2026-10-25T18:07:32.848Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-9020"}
